  "descriptions": {
    "A_current": "Routes a job-search task to the right specialists in the job-hunter family, then owns the shared per-user workspace and merges member output into one coherent result. Use when the user wants to run a job search, find a job, find jobs, openings, positions, or work, manage an end-to-end job hunt, apply to roles and track applications, do several job-search steps at once (find jobs and tailor a resume and track applications), or export, import, back up, or restore their job-hunter workspace. Routes to career-profile (set up profile + parse resume), job-search (find + score postings), resume-tailor (tailor or tighten a resume, anti-fabrication gate), cover-letter (cover letters, same gate), application-tracker (track applications + follow-ups), interview-prep (prep for a scheduled interview, same gate), job-outreach (recruiter outreach, same gate), and outcome-learning (learn from outcomes). Do not use for a single isolated step that names its own skill (use that member directly) or for non-job-search tasks.",
    "B_pretrim_plus_outreach": "Routes a job-search task to the right specialists in the job-hunter family, then owns the shared per-user workspace and merges member output into one coherent result. Use when the user wants to run a job search, find a job, find jobs, openings, positions, or work, manage an end-to-end job hunt, apply to roles and track applications, do several job-search steps at once (find jobs and tailor a resume and track applications), or export, import, back up, or restore their job-hunter workspace (for example on a new machine). Routes to career-profile (set up profile + parse resume), job-search (find + score postings), resume-tailor (tailor or tighten a resume with the anti-fabrication gate), cover-letter (cover letters, same gate), application-tracker (track applications + follow-ups), interview-prep (prep for a scheduled interview, same gate), job-outreach (recruiter outreach, same gate), and outcome-learning (learn from outcomes). Do not use for a single isolated step that names its own skill (use that member directly) or for non-job-search tasks."
